graph TD
    REQ[Client Payment Request (Idempotency-Key Header)] --> CHK_REDIS{Redis SETNX Lock Exists?}
    CHK_REDIS -- YES (Identical) --> CACHED[Return Cached Response Immediately]
    CHK_REDIS -- YES (Mismatched) --> ERR[HTTP 409 Conflict]
    CHK_REDIS -- NO --> EXEC[Acquire 24h Lock & Process Transaction]
